// A CONSTRUCTOR IS A FUNCTION VALUE. Born RED 2026-09-08 while ratcheting
// the eta-wrapper census: seven of the wheel's eta-wrappers existed ONLY
// because `map((v) => TVar(v), vs)` could not be written `map(TVar, vs)`,
// and the reason was not a type error — the bare form compiled with ZERO
// diagnostics, lowered to a payload-less variant whatever the arity, and
// faulted `unreachable` at the first match that read what it built.
//
// GREEN 2026-09-09: a bare name is the parameter product with every field
// a hole (SYNTAX §«Partial application» — `Box` IS `Box(??)`), so it
// reifies through the same partial mint, with no supplied args and no new
// mechanism. The arity is the declaration's own, read from the env scheme:
// a nullary reference types as the ADT rather than as a TFun, so the use
// site cannot tell "no parameters" from "not yet resolved" and only the
// declaration can. Answers 6. The op face is mn-op-as-value.mn.
type Box = Box(Int) | Empty

fn unbox(b) = match b {
  Box(n) => n,
  Empty => 0,
}

fn main() = map(Box, [1, 2, 3]) |> map(unbox) |> fold(0, (a, b) => a + b)
